The legal texts in this repository are the Constitucion Politica and the Leyes of the Republic of Costa Rica as
published by SINALEVI (Sistema Nacional de Legislacion Vigente), Procuraduria General de la Republica,
https://sinalevi.go.cr. The site states "(c) Procuraduria de la Republica. Todos los derechos reservados" and publishes
no reuse terms.

Ley 6683, Ley de Derechos de Autor y Derechos Conexos, articulo 75: anyone may freely reproduce the constitutions,
laws, decrees, municipal agreements, regulations and other public acts, on condition that they follow the official
edition strictly. The wording was not changed here; it was only split into files and lines. The official text is the
one published in La Gaceta.

This repository is private. Check the position on the compilation (SINALEVI's arrangement and notes) before making it
public.

Lexifina's own contributions (the tools, the arrangement into files, the commit messages and the data files under
data/) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
